    "Overreach: The answer states that the email campaign \"reduced conversion rates,\" implying a causal effect, but the data are observational and channel assignment was not randomised.",
    "Unacknowledged data problems: The analyst dropped refunded orders when computing conversion rates, changing the denominator and biasing the rates. This deviation from the proper definition of conversion rate is not mentioned."
